                    <div class="w-100 d-flex justify-content-center p-0">
                        <div id="editorReview" class="w-100 m-0 p-0"></div> @*Could be replaced with https://demos.blazorbootstrap.com/markdown if the images were accessible through a link.*@
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row py-1 m-0 text-center w-100 d-flex justify-content-center">
                    <div class="col-6 d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center p-0">                    
                            <div class="container-fluid">
